{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-21 03:01:51 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: test_project_beta] Documenting concurrent agent naming limitation. Session collision occurs when same agent name + same repo + different Scribe projects run in parallel. Best practice: use scoped agent names (CoderAgent-TaskA, CoderAgent-TaskB) for concurrent work in same repo. | issue=MCP transport limitation; phase=documentation; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/test_project_beta/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-21T03:01:51.890123+00:00_034dbafd", "timestamp": "2026-01-21T03:01:51.890158+00:00"}
{"op": "commit", "ref_id": "2026-01-21T03:01:51.890123+00:00_034dbafd", "timestamp": "2026-01-21T03:01:51.900532+00:00"}
